{
  "sn45.4:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 45.4 ",
  "sn45.4:0.2": "1. Avijjāvagga ",
  "sn45.4:0.3": "Jāṇussoṇibrāhmaṇasutta ",
  "sn45.4:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn45.4:1.2": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya sāvatthiṁ piṇḍāya pāvisi. ",
  "sn45.4:1.3": "Addasā kho āyasmā ānando jāṇussoṇiṁ brāhmaṇaṁ sabbasetena vaḷavābhirathena sāvatthiyā niyyāyantaṁ. ",
  "sn45.4:1.4": "Setā sudaṁ assā yuttā honti setālaṅkārā, seto ratho, setaparivāro, setā rasmiyo, setā patodalaṭṭhi, setaṁ chattaṁ, setaṁ uṇhīsaṁ, setāni vatthāni, setā upāhanā, setāya sudaṁ vālabījaniyā bījīyati. ",
  "sn45.4:1.5": "Tamenaṁ jano disvā evamāha: ",
  "sn45.4:1.6": "“brahmaṁ vata, bho, yānaṁ. ",
  "sn45.4:1.7": "Brahmayānarūpaṁ vata, bho”ti. ",
  "sn45.4:2.1": "Atha kho āyasmā ānando sāvatthiyaṁ piṇḍāya caritvā pacchābhattaṁ piṇḍapātapaṭikkanto yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho āyasmā ānando bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "sn45.4:3.1": "“Idhāhaṁ, bhante, pubbaṇhasamayaṁ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya sāvatthiṁ piṇḍāya pāvisiṁ. ",
  "sn45.4:3.2": "Addasaṁ khvāhaṁ, bhante, jāṇussoṇiṁ brāhmaṇaṁ sabbasetena vaḷavābhirathena sāvatthiyā niyyāyantaṁ. ",
  "sn45.4:3.3": "Setā sudaṁ assā yuttā honti setālaṅkārā, seto ratho, setaparivāro, se